  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity strengthening for CTP and Partner staff.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTP is a partnership organization working with different national organizations in Lakes, Warrap, Central and Upper Nile states in South Sudan implementing multisectoral humanitarian and development programmes. CTP plans to conduct trainings for its partners and staff on disability inclusion into programmes based on the Washington group definitions and guidelines.  SADI refresher trainings has also been planned for our partners as part of inclusion and protection mainstreaming based on different humanitarian standards in all CTP interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
